<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartItemBase">
    <defName>EH_FlameHeart</defName>
    <label>Flame Serum</label>
    <description>A single-use injection that transforms a pawn into a Flame Ascendant, granting permanent whole-body elemental powers. Self-inject or administer through a medical bill. Only one elemental ascension per pawn.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Health/ElementalHearts/FlameSerum</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.8</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.CompProperties_ElementalSerum">
        <hediff>EH_FlameHeart</hediff>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
  <HediffDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartHediffBase">
    <defName>EH_FlameHeart</defName>
    <label>Flame Ascendant</label>
    <description>A Flame Ascendant commands Ember Cleave, Cinder Step, Inferno Waltz and Phoenix Descent, combining sword strikes with thermal injury. Heat resistance reduces thermal damage received by 75% and raises the upper comfortable temperature by 100 C. Phoenix Vitality seals wounds after three seconds and heals ordinary injuries; missing parts and scars are not regenerated. Teach creates Flame disciples; evolve into Azure Flame after 150 mastery kills and ten Ascendant days.

Damage: this lineage multiplies the Melee damage stat by 2 (+100%). The shared 20% reduction makes an otherwise identical eligible physical melee packet 1.6 times its unascended value before armor and other modifiers. This is not a fixed skill-damage value: techniques scale from the current melee profile and use their own multipliers, marks and, where applicable, separate elemental hits. Do not apply the lineage multiplier a second time to the weapon profile.

Teamwork: elemental techniques can synchronize with nearby allied transformed Ascendants for brief shared bonuses and elemental support. Each participant has one six-second support cooldown.</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameRecovery">
        <sealAfterTicks>180</sealAfterTicks>
        <healPerSecond>2</healPerSecond>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlamePassives">
        <strikeThermal>0.5</strikeThermal>
        <chainChance>0.25</chainChance>
        <chainRadius>4</chainRadius>
        <chainDamageFactor>0.4</chainDamageFactor>
        <chainTargets>3</chainTargets>
        <chainInterval>6</chainInterval>
        <maxCharge>5</maxCharge>
        <chargeDuration>600</chargeDuration>
        <killCooldownReduction>90</killCooldownReduction>
        <dancePerCharge>0.6</dancePerCharge>
        <heavenPerCharge>1</heavenPerCharge>
        <counterChance>0.5</counterChance>
        <counterCooldown>120</counterCooldown>
        <resistanceFactor>0.25</resistanceFactor>
        <thermalDamageDefs>
          <li>EH_Flame</li>
          <li>Flame</li>
          <li>Burn</li>
        </thermalDamageDefs>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameAbilities">
        <severRange>10</severRange>
        <flashRange>15</flashRange>
        <danceRadius>4</danceRadius>
        <heavenRange>12</heavenRange>
        <severCooldown>300</severCooldown>
        <flashCooldown>360</flashCooldown>
        <danceCooldown>540</danceCooldown>
        <heavenCooldown>1350</heavenCooldown>
        <telegraphTicks>12</telegraphTicks>
        <staggerTicks>60</staggerTicks>
        <fistFloor>10</fistFloor>
        <explosionRadius>3</explosionRadius>
        <severPhysical>1.5</severPhysical>
        <severThermal>0.8</severThermal>
        <flashPhysical>2</flashPhysical>
        <flashThermal>1</flashThermal>
        <dancePhysical>1.5</dancePhysical>
        <danceThermal>1</danceThermal>
        <heavenPhysical>6</heavenPhysical>
        <heavenThermal>4</heavenThermal>
        <explosionThermal>1.5</explosionThermal>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameMastery" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
